   "the parent rows are reference only and are not paired",
   "the rated power is the resistor's nominal value, not a temperature-derated value at the local ambient",
   "the steady burden power is mean(V^2)/R; the 69.6/103 mW figures in SOURCE-05 used mean(V)^2/R and are low by the form factor squared (about 1.21x)",
